{"version":1,"content":"<p>天王郭富城首個於啟德主場館舉行的跨年演唱會將在下月開鑼，努力備戰嘅佢原來仲有諗頭，台灣消息指郭富城下一站係台北大巨蛋，對此，郭富城經理人更已有回應。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;由於啟德跨年演唱會未演先轟</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:31:46.276007+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:18:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T03:24:55.675016+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T03:24:55.675016+00:00","content_hash":"a4c44250c89c65d3fd8fa85c6ecc850157e174b1fa9aa2acfdc1379b5c37ee90","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}